\section{Conclusion}
This paper studied the design of PASS, where physical constraints on PA movement and the adjustable antenna radiation power were accounted for. The antenna positions, radiation power, and transmit beamforming were jointly optimized to minimize the average power consumption for both continuous and discrete antenna movement.
