\noindent\textbf{Concern \ding{185}:} \emph{Can resource-limited edge devices do the heavy lifting of AI-driven sensing?}
Real-world deployment highlights the computational constraints of edge devices running advanced machine learning and AI models. Even optimized models can strain on-device resources, especially when devices must handle data collection, pre-processing, and inference simultaneously. Offloading high-dimensional CSI data to the cloud introduces additional complications: bandwidth may become a bottleneck, and latency can degrade system responsiveness.

