\subsection{Foundation Module Design}
\label{sec:foundation}
Based on user requirements and real-world constraints, we present a fully integrated motion detection and speed estimation module that builds on existing WiFi sensing research~\cite{widetect,Wispeed2018,gaitway}. It addresses these inherent signal complexities to passively detect occupants, even through walls, without the need for tailored calibration. Our holistic design allows seamless integration in diverse home environments, thereby offering a way for practical, cost-effective, and privacy-preserving occupant detection.
Below, we briefly review the core sensing algorithms used in our system; more detailed information can be found in the original papers~\cite{widetect,Wispeed2018,gaitway}. 

