        \midrule
        $\safe \phi \rightarrow \bigvee_{G \in N^3} E_G(\phi \wedge \safe \phi)$& \text{Mix}\\
        From $\phi \rightarrow \bigvee_{G \in N^3}E_G\phi$, derive $\phi \rightarrow \safe \phi$& Induction\\
