\section{Broader Impact Statement}
Since VC models can synthesize speech with high speaker similarity, they carry potential risks, such as spoofing voice identification systems or impersonating specific speakers. To prevent misuse, it is crucial to develop robust speech detection methods and avoid voice authentication in high-security applications.

