\subsection{Numerical setting and training}

To conduct the experiment, we first generate our dataset. This dataset is created by reproducing the lossless switching circuit in Fig.~\ref{fig:boost} and the large-signal averaged model shown in Fig.~\ref{fig:boost_avm} in MATLAB® Simulink. The simulation parameters to create the dataset are provided in Table~{\ref{tab:simulation parameters}}.

