For this experiment we aim to solve the system on $[t_0, \tend]=[0,20]$, with $\alpha=1.1$, $\beta=0.4$, $\gamma=0.4$, $\delta =0.1$ and $x(0)=y(0)=10$. The error estimator from $\eqref{eq:estimator}$ reads
