Estimation of thermal properties and boundary heat transfer coefficient of the ground with a Bayesian technique \\	% Line 1
\vspace{4pt}}

\author{Zhanat Karashbayeva \textsuperscript{a, b}$^{\ast}$, Julien Berger\textsuperscript{a}, Helcio R.B. Orlande\textsuperscript{c}, Marie-Hélène Azam\textsuperscript{d}}
