\subsubsection*{Combination Approach}

The combination approach involves aggregating the information from multiple rows in the snapshot into a single comprehensive sentence, then encoding this aggregated sentence to represent the CJN. Figure~\ref{fig:combination-cjn-linearization} presents the steps for the combination approach. 
This approach aggregates the rows using the Multivalue technique, which concatenates the values of each attribute across all rows within the snapshot, then we generate a single comprehensive sentence.

