We begin by evaluating the performance of various CJN models on all available query sets. Figure~\ref{plot:cjn-ranking-allqueryset} presents the Mean Reciprocal Rank (MRR) and Recall@k (R@k) scores for each model.

\begin{figure*}[!htb]
