We evaluate the performance using two metrics. First, we calculate the average number of thoughts for prompts categorized as Easy, Medium, and Hard. Second, we perform t-tests to obtain p-values that compare the mean thought counts between these difficulty levels. The two metrics help us to determine if there is a statistical significant difference between the prompts of varying complexity; this is required to inform the classifier.
