This paper proposes space-time multigrid methods which are suitable for performing topology optimisation of transient heat conduction problems. In particular, it proposes coarsening strategies which are suitable for high-contrast problems, investigates different methods of defining the discretisation on the coarse grids, and demonstrates the robustness of these strategies and methods. 


