\subsubsection{Attacker's Capabilities}\label{secAtkassum}
We make the following assumptions about the attacker's capabilities: \textit{(1)} The scheduler is trustworthy and can not be compromised by the attacker. Consequently, the attacker lacks direct control over task execution and is restricted to leveraging compromised tasks only when the scheduler permits.
