\noindent The periodicity selection criteria used in Claim~\ref{claim:sampling_period_analysis} heavily restricts the periodicity choices since higher values of $n\in\mathbb{N}^+$ are often not supported by Claim~\ref{clmclf}. We update the criteria as follows in order to get multiple periodicity choices for a victim task with reduced IR. 
