\subsection{Application}

\textbf{\textcolor{update}{Crowd Animation}} \quad The unconditional generation of the one-to-many motion synthesis can efficiently provide a diverse set of characters with similar structure performing the same internal patterns in different ways, as shown in Figure \ref{fig:app}(a).

\begin{figure}
