\item An interpretation function for actions $\de{-}_\act \colon \act \to \st \to D(\st)$ that is monotone (\ie $\de{a}_\act\!(s) \sqsubseteq \de{a'}_\act\!(s)$ if $a \le_\act a'$) and one for tests $\de{-}_\test \colon \test \to \st \to \mathbb B$.
