As we saw in \Cref{sec:powerdomains}, a pomset language is a set of finite pomsets without any tests or formulae. Control flow is determined by $\code{assume}$ actions, which keep or eliminate traces depending on the whether the corresponding test passes or fails.
\[
  \pomlang \triangleq \mathcal{P}(\pom_\fin(\lab_\powdom))
\]
